[6.565007, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m Summary size is at most \u001b[33m72\u001b[0m characters\r\n  \u001b[31m✗\u001b[0m Commits MUST be prefixed with a type, which consists of a noun:\r\n    \u001b[33mbuild\u001b[0m, \u001b[33mchore\u001b[0m, \u001b[33mdocs\u001b[0m, \u001b[33mfeat\u001b[0m, \u001b[33mfix\u001b[0m, \u001b[33mperf\u001b[0m, \u001b[33mrefactor\u001b[0m, \u001b[33mrevert\u001b[0m, \u001b[33mstyle\u001b[0m, \u001b[33mtest\u001b[0m, \u001b[33madd\u001b[0m, \u001b[33mremove\u001b[0m\r\n    The prefix must be followed by the OPTIONAL scope, OPTIONAL !,\r\n    and REQUIRED terminal colon and space.\r\n    A scope MAY be provided after a type. A scope MUST consist of a noun describing\r\n    a section of the codebase surrounded by parenthesis, e.g., fix(parser)\r\n"]
